<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lone Star Steakhouse.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lone Star Steakhouse.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it cut its rating on Lone Star Steakhouse &amp; Saloon Inc and Outback Steakhouse Inc to market perform from outperform and raised its rating on Brinker International Inc to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Lone Star was down 1-13/16 at 31-1/4, Outback was off 1/2 at 26-1/4 and Brinkers was up 3/8 at 16-3/4.</p>
</text>
